OL,3,GNEWSATerminally ill dad's cancer
OL,4,Acampaign inspires song
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two who has raised #200,000
OL,7,Ffor charity since being diagnosed with
OL,8,Fterminal bowel cancer has inspired a
OL,9,FStoke-on-Trent musician to write a song
OL,10,Fafter hearing his story.
OL,12,FKevin Griffiths from Trentham was
OL,13,Fdiagnosed in 2020, aged 44, and his
OL,14,Fcancer has since spread.
OL,16,FDespite being told he had just two
OL,17,Fyears to live, he launched Cancer My
OL,18,FArse, a campaign raising money for
OL,19,Fcharities and awareness of the disease.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
