OL,3,GNEWSATerminally ill dad's cancer
OL,4,Acampaign inspires song
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Deakin, who performs under the
OL,7,Fname Deak Gray, was so impressed by his
OL,8,Fefforts that he wrote a song about
OL,9,Fcancer called Woke Up This Morning,
OL,10,Fwith money raised going to the charity.
